INE OCR

This distribution provides an independently deployable R2 OCR service under AGPL-3.0-only.
It includes fine-tuned name and card-detector weights, with no private deployment data.
The card architecture and model are based on Ultralytics YOLOv8n, AGPL-3.0.
It uses PaddleOCR/PaddlePaddle and OpenCV WeChatQRCode components and public models.
Their licenses and attribution remain with their respective upstream projects.
See THIRD_PARTY.md and licenses/ for source references and license texts.
The original base-only code was distributed under Apache-2.0; that notice and
